<title>ITALY: Gross yield 6.56 pct on 3-month Italian T-bills.</title>
<headline>Gross yield 6.56 pct on 3-month Italian T-bills.</headline>
<dateline>ROME 1997-06-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Auction results for the sale of 11.25 trillion lire of three, six and 12-month short-term Treasury bills (BOTs).</p>
<p>		 Gross yield  (last)    Avge price   (last)</p>
<p>    3-month     6.56	(6.11)    98.39	  (98.50)</p>
<p>    6-month     6.48	(6.37)    96.87	  (96.92)</p>
<p>    1-year	6.68	(6.40)    93.75	  (94.00)</p>
<p>Note: results compare with a previous auction on May 27.</p>
</text>
